    "profile": {
      "description": "Edel Roofing and Construction Inc. has served Edinburg and the Rio Grande Valley since 2003. We install, replace, and repair residential and commercial roofs built for the Valley's heat, high winds, and storms — asphalt shingle, metal, TPO, and EPDM systems. We're the only CertainTeed Select ShingleMaster contractor in the RGV. We also handle storm and hail damage and insurance claims. Licensed and insured, with free estimates. Serving McAllen, Mission, Pharr, Weslaco, Harlingen, Brownsville, and Rio Grande City. Se habla español."
    },
